@group A
@commands Boot; `/cdevtest place` the box by its Engineering id and read the state; `tagsof`; `makes`; try the Compat id
@pass places as `creativeengineering:weathered_cardboard_box`; block tags hold `minecraft:mineable/axe` and `blockrunner:surface/soft`; made only by Create splashing from Design n' Decor's box; `creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box` is unknown; no `decor_blocks.js` error in the startup log
@fails unknown id: `items/decor_blocks.js` not in the Engineering jar (`kubejs_startup/creativeengineering/items/`); axe tag missing: `storageblocktags.js` not copied into the jar; Compat id still registers: an old Compat jar in `mods/`
@absent creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box (the old id, gone on purpose); creativeengineering:weathered_cardboard_box (registered after the last /dumpall)
