> forceload add 9000 9000 9100 9100
> cdevtest place 9032 -60 9010 creativeengineering:weathered_cardboard_box
> cdevtest state 9032 -60 9010
> cdevtest tagsof creativeengineering:weathered_cardboard_box
> cdevtest makes creativeengineering:weathered_cardboard_box
