expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof id=creativeengineering:weathered_cardboard_box block_tags=\S*blockrunner:surface/soft
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=makes item=creativeengineering:weathered_cardboard_box n=1
expect Unknown block type
